  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 reached end of support on June 1st, 2026, and no longer receives updates, including security fixes. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. Amazon CloudWatch Observability Admin adds the ability to audit telemetry configuration for AWS resources in customers AWS Accounts and Organizations. The release introduces new APIs to turn on/off the new experience, which supports discovering supported AWS resources and their state of telemetry.",
